Exit gate: the signatures cover every AC, and nothing breaks the rules file.

Java Excerpt: addScore and isPassing

 public   void  addScore(String      studentId, int     score) {
      requireKnown(studentId);                                    // AC4
      if  (score < MIN_SCORE || score > MAX_SCORE) {              // AC2, AC3
           throw   new  IllegalArgumentException("score must be 0-100: "              + score);
      }
      scores.get(studentId).add(score);
 }

 public   static   boolean   isPassing(double      score) {
      return   score >= PASS_MARK;                                // AC5: 60 passes
 }

Every rejection happens before the score is stored.

